### Terraform-generated config ####
# Written into the repo root by the file_gen_* modules on every apply, and
# regenerable from terraform.tfvars alone. Several carry plaintext secrets
# (DB and mail passwords, API tokens, the James keystore password), so they
# must never be committed.
/compose.yml
/database_init.sql
/james_initialize.sh
/crm_initialize.sh
/SSL_Agent.sh
/SSL_Fetch.sh
/connect.sh
/nginx.conf
/hosts
/php.ini
/.htaccess
/smtpserver.xml
/imapserver.xml
/mailetcontainer.xml
/keystore

